/* [EN] The canvas fills the component; size the component from outside. [CN] 画布填满组件；组件尺寸由外部设置。 */
:host {
  display: inline-block;
  width: 100px;
  height: 100px;
}

.cyl-lottie-box {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
}

.cyl-lottie-canvas {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
}

/* [EN] WeChat DevTools: out of sight while the still image shows, still drawn. `visibility: hidden` alone was not always
   honored there (the moving canvas showed through), so the canvas also moves off screen.
   [CN] 微信开发者工具：显示静态图片时移出视野，仍会绘制。仅用 `visibility: hidden` 在开发者工具中并不总是生效（移动的画布
   仍会透出），因此同时把画布移出屏幕。 */
.cyl-lottie-canvas-covered {
  position: absolute;
  left: -10000px;
  top: 0;
  visibility: hidden;
}

.cyl-lottie-snapshot {
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: 0;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
}
